# Upstream pins. Single source of truth for scripts; the engine rev is also
# pinned in crates/*/Cargo.toml (it must equal the wrapper's own Cargo pin).
# Wrapper: our fork, branch drip/engine-80f8f0b4 = upstream main ebcded58 with
# its engine pin moved to our engine fork, three invariant tests adjusted for
# the SettleB fix (inv_061, inv_071, inv_077) and one compute test added for
# its worst case (inv_077). No wrapper logic of ours.
# Engine: our fork, branch drip/engine-80f8f0b4 = upstream master 80f8f0b4 +
# dcccrypto's SettleB fix (#172; upstream 80f8f0b4 still fails its test).
# Account layout changed from ba32c912: the engine asset slot grew 1333 -> 1397
# bytes (a one-slot market account is 3099 bytes); portfolios are unchanged.
# Drop the engine fork once upstream carries the SettleB fix.
PERCOLATOR_PROG_REPO=https://github.com/Augustas11/percolator-prog
PERCOLATOR_PROG_SHA=0dd898baaeaf5febd1ad7a52026a2423ee172ad4
PERCOLATOR_ENGINE_REPO=https://github.com/Augustas11/percolator
PERCOLATOR_ENGINE_REV=605a89a2a06064fb66f8b4bd35ed6842ff4e72b1
